						 <p>The ending is so terrible Plato would say &quot;f*ck you!&quot;, but I'm not him so congrats!!</p> <p>Though I would have preferred 682 to suddenly pounce on Clef and at that moment when he will be the first meal(appetizer really) of 682, Clef gets a slimy lick from the lizard and he hears a dog-like bark. Clef opens his eyes to see 682 still in his lizard form but with a dog-personality.<br /> While amazing, the Foundation will be cautions with the newly changed SCP-682 and slowly change the lizards status to Safe and become either the Foundation's mascot or therapy lizard.</p> 
				 	]]>
