				<wikidot:authorName>MaliceAforethought</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2902864</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You use &quot;'twere&quot; incorrectly. It's a contraction of &quot;it were&quot;, and doesn't make sense here at all. To give an example of the correct usage: &quot;if 'twere written correctly, it would have been a perfect tale&quot; :P</p> <p>Other than that, very well done.</p> 
				 	]]>
